<title>POLAND: DROSED JULY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>DROSED JULY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.41 vs   0.94</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.45 vs   1.00</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.57 vs   1.25</p>
<p> Sales		   21.48 vs  13.50</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.16 vs   1.91</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.42 vs   3.09</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.99 vs   3.92</p>
<p> Sales		  119.15 vs  72.10</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish poultry producer is Siedleckie</p>
<p>Zaklady Drobiarskie Drosed SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
